RUG Puppy modifies the firmware for a local audio and control gateway, authenticated
configuration, bounded motion, offline actions, camera and privacy behavior, and
stationary play. It adds the Python companion gateway, iOS parent client, and tests.
Modified upstream source files carry an inline change notice.

